#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_ocr.rst:10
msgid "模型简介"
msgstr "Model introduction"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_ocr.rst:12
msgid ""
"OCR（光学字符识别）模型用于检测并识别图像中的文字内容，支持多种语言和字体。模型不仅能识别文字内容，还能输出文字的位置信息，适用于各种文字识别和文档理解任务。"
msgstr ""
"The OCR (Optical Character Recognition) model is used to detect and "
"recognize text content in images, supporting multiple languages ​​and "
"fonts.The model can not only recognize the text content, but also output the"
" location information of the text, which is suitable for various text "
"recognition and document understanding tasks."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_ocr.rst:14
msgid "**输出内容：**"
msgstr "**Output content:**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_ocr.rst:16
msgid "**文本内容** (识别的文字)"
msgstr "**Text content** (recognized text)"

