msgid "**文本位置** (边界框或多边形)"
msgstr "**text position** (bounding box or polygon)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_ocr.rst:18
msgid "**置信度** (识别准确度)"
msgstr "**Confidence** (recognition accuracy)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_ocr.rst:19
msgid "**文本属性** (方向、语言等)"
msgstr "**Text Properties** (direction, language, etc.)"

