msgstr "The OCR model is suitable for the following scenarios:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_ocr.rst:26
msgid "**文档数字化**：纸质文档扫描、图书数字化、档案管理"
msgstr ""
"**Document Digitization**: Paper document scanning, book digitization, file "
"management"

