msgid "**证件识别**：身份证、护照、驾照、银行卡识别"
msgstr ""
"**Document recognition**: ID card, passport, driver's license, bank card "
"recognition"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_ocr.rst:28
msgid "**车牌识别**：停车场管理、交通监控、违章检测"
msgstr ""
"**License Plate Recognition**: parking lot management, traffic monitoring, "
