msgid "**场景文字识别**：路牌、店铺招牌、产品标签"
msgstr "**Scene text recognition**: street signs, store signs, product labels"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_ocr.rst:31
msgid "**工业应用**：生产日期识别、序列号识别、条码扫描"
msgstr ""
"**Industrial Application**: Production date identification, serial number "
"identification, barcode scanning"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_ocr.rst:32
msgid "**智能翻译**：实时文字翻译、菜单翻译"
msgstr ""
"**Intelligent translation**: real-time text translation, menu translation"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_ocr.rst:33
msgid "**辅助阅读**：为视障人士朗读文字内容"
msgstr ""
"**Assisted Reading**: Read text content aloud for visually impaired people"

