msgstr "Batch processing improves throughput"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_ocr.rst:190
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "FAQ"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_ocr.rst:192
msgid "**Q: 识别准确率不高怎么办？**"
msgstr "**Q: What should I do if the recognition accuracy is not high?**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_ocr.rst:194
msgid "A: 尝试以下方法："
msgstr "A: Try the following:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_ocr.rst:196
msgid "提高图像质量（清晰度、对比度）"
msgstr "Improve image quality (sharpness, contrast)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_ocr.rst:197
msgid "增加图像分辨率，确保文字清晰"
msgstr "Increase image resolution to ensure text is clear"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_ocr.rst:198
msgid "调整置信度阈值，过滤低质量结果"
msgstr "Adjust confidence threshold to filter out low-quality results"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_ocr.rst:199
msgid "使用预处理技术（去噪、增强）"
msgstr "Use preprocessing techniques (denoising, enhancement)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_ocr.rst:200
msgid "确保光照均匀，避免反光和阴影"
msgstr "Ensure even lighting and avoid reflections and shadows"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_ocr.rst:202
msgid "**Q: 如何识别倾斜的文字？**"
msgstr "**Q: How to identify slanted text?**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_ocr.rst:204
msgid ""
"A: OCR模型通常支持一定角度的倾斜文字（通常±15度）。输出的 ``polygon`` "
"字段会给出倾斜文字的精确轮廓。对于大角度倾斜，建议先进行图像旋转校正。"
msgstr ""
"A: OCR models usually support tilted text at a certain angle (usually ±15 "
"degrees).The output polygon field gives the precise outline of the slanted "
"text.For large angle tilts, it is recommended to perform image rotation "
"correction first."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_ocr.rst:206
msgid "**Q: 能识别手写文字吗？**"
msgstr "**Q: Can handwritten text be recognized?**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_ocr.rst:208
msgid "A: 通用OCR模型主要针对印刷体文字。手写文字需要专门的手写识别模型。手写识别通常准确率较低，特别是对于潦草的手写。"
msgstr ""
"A: The general OCR model is mainly for printed text.Handwritten text "
"requires specialized handwriting recognition models.Handwriting recognition "
"is often less accurate, especially for sloppy handwriting."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_ocr.rst:210
msgid "**Q: 如何获得文字的阅读顺序？**"
msgstr "**Q: How to get the reading order of text?**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_ocr.rst:212
msgid "A:"
msgstr "A:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_ocr.rst:213
msgid "使用 ``full_text`` 字段获得按阅读顺序排列的完整文本"
msgstr "Use the ``full_text`` field to get the full text in reading order"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_ocr.rst:214
msgid "或根据每个文本块的 ``bbox`` 坐标，按照从上到下、从左到右的规则排序"
msgstr ""
"Or sort according to the rules of top to bottom and left to right according "
"to the ``bbox`` coordinates of each text block"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_ocr.rst:216
msgid "**Q: 为什么有些文字没被识别？**"
msgstr "**Q: Why are some characters not recognized?**"

